  <p>
    The home page and six tool pages (<code>/heic-to-jpg</code>, <code>/compress-image</code>,
    <code>/compress-image-to-500kb</code>, <code>/remove-exif</code>, <code>/png-to-webp</code>, and
    <code>/compress-png</code> — seven pages in total, across both locales) load Preact components
    with <code>client:load</code>, so Preact itself and the Astro Island client runtime (below) are
    shipped to the browser. This page (<code>/licenses</code>) and the 404 pages are static
    HTML/CSS-only pages that never load any of this JavaScript.
